{"v":1,"accession":"PRJNA1471563","title":"Microbial community dynamics in WY-4 bioaugmented UASB reactors under complex shock","description":"This project investigates the effects of homoacetogenic bioaugmentation on microbial community dynamics, process stability, and recovery performance in UASB reactors subjected to short-term complex shock conditions. High-throughput sequencing of bacterial and archaeal 16S rRNA genes was performed to characterize microbial communities in control and WY-4-amended reactors. Bacterial communities were analyzed using the V3-V4 region amplified with primers 341F/806R, while archaeal communities were analyzed using the V4-V5 region amplified with primers 524F/958R. Amplicon sequencing was conducted on the Illumina NovaSeq platform. The study aims to reveal how homoacetogenic strain WY-4 influences anaerobic microbial ecology and contributes to improved reactor resilience and recovery after environmental disturbances.","center":"Harbin Institute of Technology","data_type":"Raw sequence reads","submission_date":"2026/05/28 00:00","sample_cols":["accession","title","tier","context","collection_date","collection_year","country","region","place_id","place","location_status","lat","lon","submitted_location","isolation_source","env_broad_scale","env_local_scale","env_medium","eligibility_reason"],"samples":[["SAMN60456651","MIMARKS Survey related sample from anaerobic digester metagenome","probable_urban","municipal_wastewater","2025-06-15",2025,"CN","Heilongjiang",2037013,"Harbin","verified",45.7571,126.6812,"China: Harbin",null,"engineered wastewater treatment system biome","upflow anaerobic sludge blanket reactor","anaerobic sludge","city-level location without sample-site confirmation"],["SAMN60456652","MIMARKS Survey related sample from anaerobic digester metagenome","probable_urban","municipal_wastewater","2025-06-15",2025,"CN","Heilongjiang",2037013,"Harbin","verified",45.7571,126.6812,"China: Harbin",null,"engineered wastewater tre